OL,3,GNEWSARacing over but road restrictions
OL,4,Aremain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manx Grand Prix and Classic TT
OL,7,Fracing have finished earlier than
OL,8,Fplanned this year, due to anticipated
OL,9,Fpoor weather on the Island by the end
OL,10,Fof the week.
OL,12,FBut police say the road restrictions in
OL,13,Fplace during the annual event will
OL,14,Fremain as originally scheduled.
OL,16,FAs such, cycling will continue to be
OL,17,Fbanned on the Mountain Road until 16:30
OL,18,FBST on Monday, 31 August.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
